  "description": "Ethereal Elegance: Watercolor Dusty Blue Flower Bouquets with Graceful Eucalyptus Leaves – A Botanical Symphony. Watercolor pre-made wedding invitation templates with 11 different  watercolor flower bouquets. You can use to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral farmhouse wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.\nAll vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.\nWith this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:\n11 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)\n11 JPG files\n11 SVG files\n1 Ai file (vector format)\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements\n1 PDF file\nNo logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.\nFiles are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Ethereal Elegance: Watercolor Dusty Blue Flower Bouquets with Graceful Eucalyptus Leaves – A Botanical Symphony. Watercolor pre-made wedding invitation templates with 11 different  watercolor flower bouquets. You can use to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral farmhouse wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.</p>\n<p>All vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.</p>\n<p>With this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:</p>\n<p>11 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)<br>\n11 JPG files<br>\n11 SVG files<br>\n1 Ai file (vector format)<br>\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file<br>\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements<br>\n1 PDF file</p>\n<p>No logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.</p>\n<p>Files are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.</p>",
